<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>02 · 技术选型与架构</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 31, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>依赖单向朝内、回合画成图：可维护性与可解释性同时成立</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>左：四层边界（谁可以依赖谁）；右：一次学习回合的四个节点（停在哪、从哪续）</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 640, height: 372, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>四层边界　依赖只朝内</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12, gap: 8 }}>

      <Box style={{ width: 640, height: 54, background: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 120 }}>interfaces</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 480 }}>API 与流式接口（组合根，唯一允许依赖全部的一层）</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 590, height: 54, background: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 120 }}>application</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 430 }}>用例编排、端口定义、LangGraph 状态图</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 540, height: 54, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 120 }}>domain</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 380 }}>纯函数：路由、切块、融合排序、排期、护栏</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 490, height: 54, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #3D7BD9', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9', width: 120 }}>infrastructure</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 330 }}>SQLite、模型调用、向量、文件解析</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 16 }}>
      收益：领域层不依赖网络与模型，因此检索权重、排期规则可以在离线状态下被单测覆盖——284 项测试正是建立在这条边界上。
    </Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 756, top: 190, width: 448, height: 372, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>一次回合　四个节点</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12, gap: 6 }}>

      <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 74 }}>route</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 330 }}>判意图：讲解 / 练习 / 规划 / 检索 / 计算</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 74 }}>plan</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 330 }}>复杂任务才规划，简单请求直接进模型</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 74 }}>agent</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 330 }}>模型推理，决定调哪个工具</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 74 }}>tools</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', width: 330 }}>执行工具、回填结果，可回到 agent</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 14 }}>
      每个节点执行后都落一次检查点：这就是「关掉页面还能接着跑」与「写库前停下等你确认」共同的技术前提。
    </Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 588, width: 1128, height: 46, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      评审关注点：为什么不分微服务？—— 单机单用户场景下，分层足以隔离变化，微服务只会增加部署与调试成本
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>05 / 11</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
